WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.491
(wild monkey screeching)

00:00:01.491 --> 00:00:03.198
- [Narrator] If you
were a kid in the '90s,

00:00:03.198 --> 00:00:04.555
you might remember this show.

00:00:04.555 --> 00:00:07.138
- Legends of the Hidden Temple.

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:10.779
- [Narrator] This guy
was the host, Kirk Fogg.

00:00:10.779 --> 00:00:14.696
- Ha-ha, thank you, thank
you, nice to see you.

00:00:16.833 --> 00:00:17.995
Legends of the Hidden Temple,

00:00:17.995 --> 00:00:20.585
for those who didn't watch
it, was an iconic game show

00:00:20.585 --> 00:00:23.215
out of the '90s by Nickelodeon.

00:00:23.215 --> 00:00:24.678
- Are you ready, Olmec?

00:00:24.678 --> 00:00:25.748
- Let's rock.

00:00:25.748 --> 00:00:26.935
- [Narrator] Barely anybody won.

00:00:26.935 --> 00:00:30.774
There were 120 shows, and,
like, only 30 winners.

00:00:30.774 --> 00:00:31.939
- Teams, are you ready?

00:00:31.939 --> 00:00:32.772
- Yeah!

00:00:34.214 --> 00:00:35.694
- [Narrator] I guess now we
can finally get answers

00:00:35.694 --> 00:00:38.501
to all of our Legends of
the Hidden Temple questions.

00:00:38.501 --> 00:00:40.272
- Who was Olmec?

00:00:40.272 --> 00:00:41.122
- [Narrator] Yeah, as it turns out,

00:00:41.122 --> 00:00:43.100
there was a guy standing inside his face.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:46.007
- But he stands back there and
he has the microphone here,

00:00:46.007 --> 00:00:49.286
his copy here, and he
has his hand on the lever

00:00:49.286 --> 00:00:51.267
that handles the mouth.

00:00:51.267 --> 00:00:54.494
See, I'm gonna ruin it for all the kids!

00:00:54.494 --> 00:00:57.002
A lot of people ask, who
were the temple guards?

00:00:57.002 --> 00:00:58.004
- [Kirk Voiceover] Oh, temple guard!

00:00:58.004 --> 00:01:00.740
- They were the guys who used
to help out during the show,

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:03.243
but, here's a little
behind-the-scenes secret.

00:01:03.243 --> 00:01:06.923
Occasionally, some of the
writers would dress up.

00:01:06.923 --> 00:01:09.184
I think they vicariously
got a thrill out of

00:01:09.184 --> 00:01:11.462
scaring the crap out of kids

00:01:11.462 --> 00:01:13.449
going (laughing) through the temple.

00:01:13.449 --> 00:01:15.223
I felt bad for a few of them.

00:01:15.223 --> 00:01:16.483
- [Narrator] But they did really scare

00:01:16.483 --> 00:01:17.750
the crap out of kids.

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:20.784
- This poor girl got really super-upset

00:01:20.784 --> 00:01:24.730
in the middle of the
run, and she threw up.

00:01:24.730 --> 00:01:27.783
And unfortunately, she threw
up in the Pit of Despair.

00:01:27.783 --> 00:01:29.013
- [Narrator] Oh, god!

00:01:29.013 --> 00:01:31.210
- [Kirk Fogg] Everybody asks,
what was the hardest room,

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:33.524
and I think, probably, for everybody,

00:01:33.524 --> 00:01:35.191
it was the Shrine of the Silver Monkey.

00:01:35.191 --> 00:01:38.776
These three things look similar together

00:01:38.776 --> 00:01:40.010
'cause they're kind of all silver,

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:41.205
so you have to kind of stack them on.

00:01:41.205 --> 00:01:43.676
- [Kirk Voiceover] Turn it
around, no, turn the head around!

00:01:43.676 --> 00:01:45.585
- I was actually an expert at it.

00:01:45.585 --> 00:01:47.995
- [Narrator] So, yeah, the
temple was pretty impossible.

00:01:47.995 --> 00:01:50.714
Is that the only reason
there were so few winners?

00:01:50.714 --> 00:01:52.514
- The producers were
only allowed to give out

00:01:52.514 --> 00:01:56.575
eight championships a year,
so there was a budget,

00:01:56.575 --> 00:01:58.919
and that's the truth of that.

00:01:58.919 --> 00:01:59.984
- [Narrator] Oh, no!

00:01:59.984 --> 00:02:01.013
- Oh, yeah.

00:02:01.013 --> 00:02:04.096
(swinging pop music)

